{"id": "8th-u8-q997", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "matching", "level": "SSLC", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "8", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "ta-8th-u1-mozhi", "lesson_id": "8th-u8-l1", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "disease-types-descriptions-match", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "நீலகேசி கூறும் நோயின் வகைகளையும் அவற்றின் பண்புகளையும் பொருத்துக:\nபட்டியல் I:\nஅ) தீர்வன\nஆ) தீராத் திறத்தன\nஇ) உவசமத்தின் உய்ப்பன\nஈ) பிறவிப் பிணி\nபட்டியல் II:\n1. எதனாலும் தீர்க்க முடியாத கொடிய நோய்கள்\n2. தகுந்த மருந்தினால் நீங்கக்கூடிய நோய்கள்\n3. அறநெறி திரியோக மருந்தினால் மட்டுமே நீங்கும் பெருந்துன்பம்\n4. வெளித்தோற்றத்தில் அடங்கி இருந்தாலும் உள்ளே இருந்து துன்புறுத்துவன"}], "options": {"A": "அ-2, ஆ-1, இ-4, ஈ-3", "B": "அ-1, ஆ-2, இ-3, ஈ-4", "C": "அ-2, ஆ-4, இ-1, ஈ-3", "D": "அ-4, ஆ-1, இ-2, ஈ-3"}, "explanation": "பாடநூல் பக். 156: தீர்வன - மருந்தால் நீங்குபவை (2); தீராத் திறத்தன - எதனாலும் தீராதவை (1); உவசமத்தின் உய்ப்பன - அடங்கி இருப்பது போல் உள்ளிருந்து துன்பம் தருவன (4); பிறவிப்பிணி - திரியோக மருந்தால் தீரும் துன்பம் (3). சரியான வரிசை: 2, 1, 4, 3."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Match the categories of diseases in Neelakesi with their characteristics:\nList I:\na) Theervana\nb) Theeraath thiratthanav\nc) Uvasamatthin uyppana\nd) Piravip pini (Rebirth grief)\nList II:\n1. Terrible ailments incurable by any means\n2. Ailments curable through proper medicines\n3. The grand existential misery cured only by Triyoga ethical virtues\n4. Outwardly dormant symptoms causing persistent inner suffering"}], "options": {"A": "a-2, b-1, c-4, d-3", "B": "a-1, b-2, c-3, d-4", "C": "a-2, b-4, c-1, d-3", "D": "a-4, b-1, c-2, d-3"}, "explanation": "Textbook Page 156: Theervana - curable (2); Theeraath thiratthanav - incurable (1); Uvasamatthin uyppana - dormant inner torment (4); Piravip pini - cured by Triyoga (3). Sequence: 2, 1, 4, 3."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": {"left": [], "right": []}, "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "A", "accepted_keys": ["A"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "answer_notes": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false, "shuffle_options": true, "is_active_eligible": true}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "8", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 156, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": null, "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null, "question_number": null, "official_question_paper_url": null, "official_answer_key_url": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["8th-tamil", "iyal-8", "neelakesi", "disease-characteristics", "matching", "tnpsc"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-03T00:00:00Z", "updated_by": null, "updated_at": null, "verified_by": "subject_expert_tamil", "verified_at": "2026-11-03T00:00:00Z", "archived_at": null}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "8th-u8-q998", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "matching", "level": "SSLC", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "8", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "ta-8th-u1-mozhi", "lesson_id": "8th-u8-l1", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "ainchiru-kaappiyangal-match", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "ஐஞ்சிறு காப்பியங்களையும் அவற்றின் முதன்மைக் கூறுகளையும் பொருத்துக:\nபட்டியல் I:\nஅ) நீலகேசி\nஆ) சூளாமணி\nஇ) யசோதர காவியம்\nஈ) உதயணகுமார காவியம்\nபட்டியல் II:\n1. இசைக்கலைஞனான உதயணனின் வரலாற்றைக் கூறும் சிறு காப்பியம்\n2. குண்டலகேசிக்கு மறுப்பாக எழுதப்பட்ட பத்துச் சருக்கங்கள் கொண்ட தருக்க நூல்\n3. உயிர்க்கொலை தீது என்பதை வலியுறுத்தும் அவந்தி நாட்டு மன்னன் கதை\n4. தோலாமொழித்தேவரால் இயற்றப்பட்ட சிறந்த சமண சிறு காப்பியம்"}], "options": {"A": "அ-1, ஆ-2, இ-3, ஈ-4", "B": "அ-2, ஆ-4, இ-3, ஈ-1", "C": "அ-2, ஆ-1, இ-4, ஈ-3", "D": "அ-4, ஆ-2, இ-1, ஈ-3"}, "explanation": "நீலகேசி - குண்டலகேசிக்கு மறுப்பான 10 சருக்க தருக்க நூல் (2); சூளாமணி - தோலாமொழித்தேவர் (4); யசோதர காவியம் - உயிர்க்கொலை தீது (3); உதயணகுமார காவியம் - உதயணன் வரலாறு (1). சரியான வரிசை: 2, 4, 3, 1."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Match the Five Minor Epics with their distinctive literary features:\nList I:\na) Neelakesi\nb) Soolamani\nc) Yasodhara Kaviyam\nd) Udhayanakumara Kaviyam\nList II:\n1. Minor epic detailing the chronicle of musician prince Udhayanan\n2. Ten-canto logical polemic written as a rebuttal to Kundalakesi\n3. Tale of King of Avanti highlighting ahimsa against animal sacrifice\n4. Celebrated Jain minor epic authored by Tholamozhithevar"}], "options": {"A": "a-1, b-2, c-3, d-4", "B": "a-2, b-4, c-3, d-1", "C": "a-2, b-1, c-4, d-3", "D": "a-4, b-2, c-1, d-3"}, "explanation": "Neelakesi - 10-canto rebuttal to Kundalakesi (2); Soolamani - Tholamozhithevar (4); Yasodhara Kaviyam - anti-sacrifice ahimsa (3); Udhayanakumara Kaviyam - life of Udhayanan (1). Sequence: 2, 4, 3, 1."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": {"left": [], "right": []}, "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "B", "accepted_keys": ["B"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "answer_notes": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false, "shuffle_options": true, "is_active_eligible": true}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "8", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 157, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": null, "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null, "question_number": null, "official_question_paper_url": null, "official_answer_key_url": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["8th-tamil", "iyal-8", "ainchiru-kaappiyangal", "matching", "tnpsc"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-03T00:00:00Z", "updated_by": null, "updated_at": null, "verified_by": "subject_expert_tamil", "verified_at": "2026-11-03T00:00:00Z", "archived_at": null}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "8th-u8-q999", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "matching", "level": "SSLC", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "8", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "ta-8th-u1-mozhi", "lesson_id": "8th-u8-l1", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "poetic-rhyme-types-match", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "பாடலின் நயங்களையும் அவற்றுக்குரிய சான்றுகளையும் பொருத்துக:\nபட்டியல் I:\nஅ) எதுகைச் சொற்கள் 1\nஆ) எதுகைச் சொற்கள் 2\nஇ) முரண் சொற்கள்\nஈ) விளிச்சொல்\nபட்டியல் II:\n1. பேர்தற்கு - தீர்தற்கு - ஓர்தல்\n2. பூணாய்\n3. தீர்வனவும் - தீராத் திறத்தனவும்\n4. தீர்வனவும் - ஊர்வனவும் - யார்வினவும்"}], "options": {"A": "அ-1, ஆ-2, இ-3, ஈ-4", "B": "அ-4, ஆ-2, இ-1, ஈ-3", "C": "அ-4, ஆ-1, இ-3, ஈ-2", "D": "அ-3, ஆ-1, இ-4, ஈ-2"}, "explanation": "பாடநூல் பக். 157: எதுகை 1: தீர்வனவும் - ஊர்வனவும் (4); எதுகை 2: பேர்தற்கு - தீர்தற்கு (1); முரண்: தீர்வனவும் - தீராத் திறத்தனவும் (3); விளிச்சொல்: பூணாய் (2). சரியான வரிசை: 4, 1, 3, 2."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Match the poetic devices from the poem with their corresponding textual illustrations:\nList I:\na) Ethugai set 1\nb) Ethugai set 2\nc) Muran (Antithetical pair)\nd) Vili (Vocative word)\nList II:\n1. Paertharkku - Theertharkku - Orthal\n2. Poonaai\n3. Theervanavum - Theeraath thiratthanavum\n4. Theervanavum - Oorvanavum - Yaarvinavum"}], "options": {"A": "a-1, b-2, c-3, d-4", "B": "a-4, b-2, c-1, d-3", "C": "a-4, b-1, c-3, d-2", "D": "a-3, b-1, c-4, d-2"}, "explanation": "Textbook Page 157: Ethugai 1: Theervanavum - Oorvanavum (4); Ethugai 2: Paertharkku - Theertharkku (1); Muran: Theervanavum - Theeraatha (3); Vocative: Poonaai (2). Matching order: 4, 1, 3, 2."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": {"left": [], "right": []}, "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "C", "accepted_keys": ["C"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "answer_notes": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false, "shuffle_options": true, "is_active_eligible": true}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "8", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 157, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": null, "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null, "question_number": null, "official_question_paper_url": null, "official_answer_key_url": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["8th-tamil", "iyal-8", "neelakesi", "poetic-devices", "matching", "tnpsc"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-03T00:00:00Z", "updated_by": null, "updated_at": null, "verified_by": "subject_expert_tamil", "verified_at": "2026-11-03T00:00:00Z", "archived_at": null}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "8th-u8-q1000", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "grammar", "level": "SSLC", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "8", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "ta-8th-u1-mozhi", "lesson_id": "8th-u8-l1", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "ivaiyundaar-split-grammar", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "'இவையுண்டார்' என்னும் சொல்லைப் பிரித்து எழுதுவதற்குரிய சரியான முறை மற்றும் புணர்ச்சி விதியைத் தேர்வு செய்க:\nஅ) இ + உண்டார் எனப் பிரியும்; உயிரீற்றுப் புணர்ச்சி\nஆ) இவ் + உண்டார் எனப் பிரியும்; உடம்படுமெய்ப் புணர்ச்சி\nஇ) இவை + யுண்டார் எனப் பிரியும்; விகாரப் புணர்ச்சி\nஈ) இவை + உண்டார் எனப் பிரியும்; 'இ ஈ ஐ வழி யவ்வும்' என்ற விதிப்படி உடம்படுமெய் தோன்றும்"}], "options": {"A": "விளக்கம் (அ)", "B": "விளக்கம் (ஆ)", "C": "விளக்கம் (இ)", "D": "விளக்கம் (ஈ) மட்டுமே இலக்கணப்படி சரியானது"}, "explanation": "பாடநூல் பக். 157 மதிப்பீடு வினா 2: 'இவையுண்டார்' = இவை + உண்டார். நிலைமொழி ஈற்றில் 'ஐ' இருப்பதால் உடம்படுமெய் 'ய்' தோன்றி, ய் + உ = யு என 'இவையுண்டார்' என்று புணர்ந்தது."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Select the correct split form and sandhi rule for the compound word 'Ivaiyundaar':\na) Splits into I + Undaar; vowel-ending sandhi\nb) Splits into Iv + Undaar; glide sandhi\nc) Splits into Ivai + Yundaar; mutation sandhi\nd) Splits into Ivai + Undaar; develops glide consonant 'y' as per rule 'i ee ai vazhi yavvum'"}], "options": {"A": "Explanation (a)", "B": "Explanation (b)", "C": "Explanation (c)", "D": "Explanation (d) alone is grammatically accurate"}, "explanation": "Textbook Page 157 Evaluation Q2: 'Ivaiyundaar' = Ivai + Undaar. Since the base ends in 'ai', the glide consonant 'y' is inserted, forming y + u = yu."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": {"left": [], "right": []}, "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "D", "accepted_keys": ["D"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "answer_notes": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false, "shuffle_options": true, "is_active_eligible": true}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "8", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 157, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": null, "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null, "question_number": null, "official_question_paper_url": null, "official_answer_key_url": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["8th-tamil", "iyal-8", "neelakesi", "sandhi-split", "grammar", "tnpsc"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-03T00:00:00Z", "updated_by": null, "updated_at": null, "verified_by": "subject_expert_tamil", "verified_at": "2026-11-03T00:00:00Z", "archived_at": null}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "8th-u8-q1001", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "grammar", "level": "SSLC", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "8", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "ta-8th-u1-mozhi", "lesson_id": "8th-u8-l1", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "thaamini-combine-grammar", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "'தாம் + இனி' என்பதனைச் சேர்த்து எழுதக் கிடைக்கும் சரியான சொல் யாது?\nஅ) தாமினி\nஆ) தாம்இனி\nஇ) தாம்மினி\nஈ) தோமனி"}], "options": {"A": "தாமினி ('உடல்மேல் உயிர்வந்து ஒன்றுவது இயல்பே' என்னும் விதிப்படி)", "B": "தாம்இனி", "C": "தாம்மினி", "D": "தோமனி"}, "explanation": "பாடநூல் பக். 157 மதிப்பீடு வினா 3: தாம் + இனி = தாமினி (ம் + இ = மி; உடல்மேல் உயிர்வந்து ஒன்றுவது இயல்பே என்ற விதி)."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "What is the correctly combined form of 'Thaam + Ini'?\na) Thaamini\nb) Thaam-ini\nc) Thaammini\nd) Thomani"}], "options": {"A": "Thaamini (per rule 'Udalmael uyirvanthu onruvathu iyalbae')", "B": "Thaam-ini", "C": "Thaammini", "D": "Thomani"}, "explanation": "Textbook Page 157 Evaluation Q3: Thaam + Ini = Thaamini (m + i = mi, consonant joins vowel naturally)."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": {"left": [], "right": []}, "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "A", "accepted_keys": ["A"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "answer_notes": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false, "shuffle_options": true, "is_active_eligible": true}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "8", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 157, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": null, "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null, "question_number": null, "official_question_paper_url": null, "official_answer_key_url": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["8th-tamil", "iyal-8", "neelakesi", "sandhi-combine", "grammar", "tnpsc"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-03T00:00:00Z", "updated_by": null, "updated_at": null, "verified_by": "subject_expert_tamil", "verified_at": "2026-11-03T00:00:00Z", "archived_at": null}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "8th-u8-q1002", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "grammar", "level": "SSLC", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "8", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "ta-8th-u1-mozhi", "lesson_id": "8th-u8-l1", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "poonaai-grammatical-term", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "'பூணாய்' என்னும் சொல்லின் இலக்கணக் குறிப்பு யாது?\nஅ) வினையெச்சம்\nஆ) முன்னிலை விளிப்பெயர் (மகடூஉ முன்னிலை)\nஇ) தொழிற்பெயர்\nஈ) பெயரெச்சம்"}], "options": {"A": "வினையெச்சம்", "B": "முன்னிலை விளிப்பெயர் (அணிகலன் அணிந்தவளே என விளித்தல்)", "C": "தொழிற்பெயர்", "D": "பெயரெச்சம்"}, "explanation": "பாடநூல் பக். 156: 'பூணாய்' என்பது 'அணிகலன்களை அணிந்தவளே!' என்று பெண்ணை விளித்து அழைக்கும் முன்னிலை விளிப் பெயர்ச்சொல் ஆகும்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "What is the grammatical classification of the term 'Poonaai'?\na) Verbal participle (Vinaiyeccam)\nb) Second-person feminine vocative noun (Munnilai Vilippeyar)\nc) Verbal noun (Thozhirpeyar)\nd) Relative participle (Peyareccam)"}], "options": {"A": "Verbal participle", "B": "Second-person vocative noun (addressing an adorned lady)", "C": "Verbal noun", "D": "Relative participle"}, "explanation": "Textbook Page 156: 'Poonaai' is a classical second-person poetic feminine vocative noun meaning 'O adorned lady!'."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": {"left": [], "right": []}, "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "B", "accepted_keys": ["B"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "answer_notes": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false, "shuffle_options": true, "is_active_eligible": true}, "source": {"type