{"id": "8th-u8-q1028", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "grammar", "level": "SSLC", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "8", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "ta-8th-u8-manitham", "lesson_id": "8th-u8-l2", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "ambedkar-name-origin-grammar", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "'பீமாராவ் ராம்ஜி அம்பேத்கர்' என்னும் பெயரின் அமைப்பில் உள்ள இலக்கண மற்றும் பெயரமைப்புக் கூறுகளை ஆராய்க:\nஅ) 'பீமாராவ்' என்பது சொந்தப் பெயர், 'ராம்ஜி' என்பது தாயின் பெயர், 'அம்பேத்கர்' என்பது சாதிப் பெயர்\nஆ) 'பீமாராவ்' என்பது பட்டப் பெயர், 'ராம்ஜி' என்பது மன்னரின் பெயர்\nஇ) 'பீமாராவ்' என்பது சொந்தப் பெயர், 'ராம்ஜி' என்பது தந்தையின் பெயர்; 'அம்பேத்கர்' என்பது அவரது சொந்த ஊரான அம்பவாதே மற்றும் ஆசிரியர் மீதான மதிப்பால் அமைந்த வழக்குப் பெயர்\nஈ) மூன்றுமே மகாராட்டிர மன்னர்களால் வழங்கப்பட்ட அரசியல் விருதுப் பெயர்களாகும்"}], "options": {"A": "விளக்கம் (அ)", "B": "விளக்கம் (ஆ)", "C": "விளக்கம் (ஈ)", "D": "விளக்கம் (இ) மட்டுமே வரலாற்று மற்றும் பெயரமைப்பில் முற்றிலும் சரியானது"}, "explanation": "பாடநூல் பக். 158: பீமாராவ் - சொந்தப் பெயர்; ராம்ஜி - தந்தை பெயர்; அம்பவாதே என்னும் சொந்த ஊரின் அடிப்படையில் ஆசிரியர் வழங்கிய அன்பான பெயர் அம்பேத்கர். எனவே (இ) சரியானது."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Analyze the onomastic structure and naming components of 'Bhimrao Ramji Ambedkar':\na) 'Bhimrao' is personal name, 'Ramji' is mother's name, 'Ambedkar' is caste surname\nb) 'Bhimrao' is royal title, 'Ramji' is benefactor's name\nc) 'Bhimrao' is personal name, 'Ramji' is father's patronymic; 'Ambedkar' derives from his village Ambavade and reverence for his revered teacher\nd) All three are administrative titles conferred by Marathi rulers"}], "options": {"A": "Explanation (a)", "B": "Explanation (b)", "C": "Explanation (d)", "D": "Explanation (c) alone is historically and culturally accurate"}, "explanation": "Textbook Page 158: Bhimrao is his personal name, Ramji is his father's patronymic, and Ambedkar reflects village Ambavade and his beloved school teacher."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": {"left": [], "right": []}, "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "D", "accepted_keys": ["D"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "answer_notes": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false, "shuffle_options": true, "is_active_eligible": true}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "8", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 158, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": null, "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null, "question_number": null, "official_question_paper_url": null, "official_answer_key_url": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["8th-tamil", "iyal-8", "ambedkar", "name-etymology", "grammar", "tnpsc"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-03T00:00:00Z", "updated_by": null, "updated_at": null, "verified_by": "subject_expert_tamil", "verified_at": "2026-11-03T00:00:00Z", "archived_at": null}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "8th-u8-q1029", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "grammar", "level": "SSLC", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "8", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "ta-8th-u5-vanigam", "lesson_id": "8th-u8-l2", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "pandaiya-kaala-vanigam-grammar", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "'பண்டைய கால இந்திய வணிகம்' என்னும் தலைப்புத் தொடரில் பயின்று வந்துள்ள இலக்கணக் கூறுகளைக் கண்டறிக:\nஅ) 'பண்டைய காலம்' என்பது காலத்தைக் குறிக்கும் பண்புத்தொடர்; 'இந்திய வணிகம்' என்பது இடப் பெயரடை வணிகப் பெயருடன் புணர்ந்த தொடர்\nஆ) இது இரட்டைக்கிளவித் தொடர் ஆகும்\nஇ) இது முற்றிலுமாக வினைமுற்றுத் தொடராகும்\nஈ) இது விளித்தொடராகும்"}], "options": {"A": "இலக்கணக் கூறு (அ) மட்டுமே சரியானது", "B": "இலக்கணக் கூறு (ஆ)", "C": "இலக்கணக் கூறு (இ)", "D": "இலக்கணக் கூறு (ஈ)"}, "explanation": "'பண்டைய காலம்' என்பது பழங்காலத்தைக் குறிக்கும் பெயர்/பண்புத் தொடர்; 'இந்திய வணிகம்' என்பது இடப்பெயர் அடையாக நின்று தொழிற்பெயருடன் அமைந்த பெயர்த் தொடராகும்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Identify the grammatical components embedded in the title phrase 'Pandaiya Kaala Inthiya Vanigam' (Ancient Indian Commerce):\na) 'Pandaiya Kaalam' is a temporal qualitative noun phrase; 'Inthiya Vanigam' is a geographical adjectival phrase modifying the business noun\nb) It is an onomatopoeic echo word (Irattai-k-kilavi)\nc) It is purely a finite verb phrase\nd) It is a vocative sentence"}], "options": {"A": "Grammatical component (a) alone is strictly correct", "B": "Grammatical component (b)", "C": "Grammatical component (c)", "D": "Grammatical component (d)"}, "explanation": "'Pandaiya Kaalam' represents an adjectival temporal modifier; 'Inthiya Vanigam' is an adjectival toponym qualifying commerce."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": {"left": [], "right": []}, "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "A", "accepted_keys": ["A"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "answer_notes": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false, "shuffle_options": true, "is_active_eligible": true}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "8", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 159, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": null, "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null, "question_number": null, "official_question_paper_url": null, "official_answer_key_url": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["8th-tamil", "iyal-8", "ambedkar", "phrase-analysis", "grammar", "tnpsc"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-03T00:00:00Z", "updated_by": null, "updated_at": null, "verified_by": "subject_expert_tamil", "verified_at": "2026-11-03T00:00:00Z", "archived_at": null}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "8th-u8-q1030", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "grammar", "level": "SSLC", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "8", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "ta-8th-u1-mozhi", "lesson_id": "8th-u8-l2", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "pagutharivu-split-grammar", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "'பகுத்தறிவு' என்னும் சொல்லின் பிரித்தல், அமைப்பு மற்றும் இலக்கணக் குறிப்பு யாது?\nஅ) பகு + அறிவு எனப் பிரியும்; உருவகத் தொடர்\nஆ) பகுத்து + அறிவு எனப் பிரியும்; வினையெச்சத் தொடர் வழியே நிலைபெற்ற கூட்டுப் பெயர்ச்சொல் (பகுத்து அறியும் அறிவு)\nஇ) பகுதி + அறிவு எனப் பிரியும்; பண்புத்தொகை\nஈ) பகுத்த + அறிவு எனப் பிரியும்; வினையாலணையும் பெயர்"}], "options": {"A": "விளக்கம் (அ)", "B": "விளக்கம் (ஆ) மட்டுமே இலக்கணப்படி சரியானது", "C": "விளக்கம் (இ)", "D": "விளக்கம் (ஈ)"}, "explanation": "பகுத்தறிவு = பகுத்து (ஆராய்ந்து) + அறிவு. எதையும் பகுத்து ஆராய்ந்து அறியும் அறிவியல் மனப்பான்மையை உணர்த்தும் கூட்டுப் பெயர்ச்சொல் ஆகும்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "What is the morphological split and grammatical designation of the compound 'Pagutharivu' (Rationalism)?\na) Splits into Pagu + Arivu; metaphorical phrase\nb) Splits into Paguthu + Arivu; compound noun originating from verbal participle clause 'knowledge that analyzes and scrutinizes'\nc) Splits into Paguthi + Arivu; qualitative compound\nd) Splits into Paguttha + Arivu; participial noun"}], "options": {"A": "Explanation (a)", "B": "Explanation (b) alone is grammatically accurate", "C": "Explanation (c)", "D": "Explanation (d)"}, "explanation": "Pagutharivu = Paguthu (analyzing) + Arivu (knowledge). A compound noun signifying the analytical, rational scrutinizing intellect."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": {"left": [], "right": []}, "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "B", "accepted_keys": ["B"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "answer_notes": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false, "shuffle_options": true, "is_active_eligible": true}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "8", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 158, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": null, "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null, "question_number": null, "official_question_paper_url": null, "official_answer_key_url": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["8th-tamil", "iyal-8", "ambedkar", "word-structure", "grammar", "tnpsc"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-03T00:00:00Z", "updated_by": null, "updated_at": null, "verified_by": "subject_expert_tamil", "verified_at": "2026-11-03T00:00:00Z", "archived_at": null}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "8th-u8-q1031", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "grammar", "level": "SSLC", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "8", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "ta-8th-u1-mozhi", "lesson_id": "8th-u8-l2", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "suyamariyaadhai-concept-tamil", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "அம்பேத்கர் தமது இரண்டாவது தெய்வமாகக் குறிப்பிடும் 'சுயமரியாதை' என்னும் கருத்தாக்கத்திற்கு இணையான தூய தமிழ்ச் சொல்/தொடர் யாது?\nஅ) பிறரை ஏளனம் செய்தல்\nஆ) செல்வச் செருக்குடன் வாழ்தல்\nஇ) தன்மதிப்பு / தன்மான உணர்வு (தான் பிறருக்குத் தாழ்ந்தவனும் அல்லன், உயர்ந்தவனும் அல்லன் என்ற சமத்துவத் தன்னுரிமை)\nஈ) தனியாக ஒதுங்கி வாழ்தல்"}], "options": {"A": "கருத்து (அ)", "B": "கருத்து (ஆ)", "C": "கருத்து (இ) மட்டுமே மிகச் சரியானது", "D": "கருத்து (ஈ)"}, "explanation": "பாடநூல் பக். 159: சுயமரியாதை என்பது தன்மானம், தன்மதிப்பு என்பதாகும். மனிதன் தனக்கான சமத்துவ உரிமையையும் சுயமரியாதையையும் காத்து வாழ்வதே உயர்வு."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "What is the authentic Tamil linguistic equivalent and concept for 'Suyamariyaadhai' (Self-Respect) celebrated as Ambedkar's second deity?\na) Mocking fellow beings\nb) Living with arrogance of wealth\nc) Thanmathippu / Thanmaanam (Inherent human dignity that bows to none as inferior and demeans none as superior)\nd) Living in total isolation"}], "options": {"A": "Concept (a)", "B": "Concept (b)", "C": "Concept (c) alone is strictly accurate", "D": "Concept (d)"}, "explanation": "Textbook Page 159: Self-Respect (Suyamariyaadhai) translates as Thanmathippu or Thanmaanam—the innate human dignity of equality."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": {"left": [], "right": []}, "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "C", "accepted_keys": ["C"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "answer_notes": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false, "shuffle_options": true, "is_active_eligible": true}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "8", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 159, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": null, "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null, "question_number": null, "official_question_paper_url": null, "official_answer_key_url": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["8th-tamil", "iyal-8", "ambedkar", "terminology", "grammar", "tnpsc"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-03T00:00:00Z", "updated_by": null, "updated_at": null, "verified_by": "subject_expert_tamil", "verified_at": "2026-11-03T00:00:00Z", "archived_at": null}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "8th-u8-q1032", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "odd_one_out", "level": "SSLC", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "8", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "ta-8th-u1-mozhi", "lesson_id": "8th-u8-l2", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "columbia-subjects-odd-one", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "அம்பேத்கர் அமெரிக்காவின் கொலம்பியா பல்கலைக்கழகத்தில் பயின்றதாகப் பாடநூலில் குறிப்பிடப்பட்டுள்ள பாடங்களுள் சேராத - பொருந்தாத துறை எது?\nஅ) பொருளாதாரம்\nஆ) அரசியல் & தத்துவம்\nஇ) சமூகவியல்\nஈ) வானியல் மற்றும் விண்வெளி அறிவியல்"}], "options": {"A": "பொருளாதாரம்", "B": "அரசியல் & தத்துவம்", "C": "சமூகவியல்", "D": "வானியல் மற்றும் விண்வெளி அறிவியல் (இப்பாடத்தை அவர் பயிலவில்லை)"}, "explanation": "பாடநூல் பக். 159: கொலம்பியா பல்கலைக்கழகத்தில் அம்பேத்கர் பயின்றவை: பொருளாதாரம், அரசியல், தத்துவம், சமூகவியல் மட்டுமே. வானியல், விண்வெளி அறிவியல் அதில் இல்லை."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Which of the following academic fields is NOT mentioned in the textbook as studied by Ambedkar at Columbia University (Odd one out)?\na) Economics\nb) Political Science and Philosophy\nc) Sociology\nd) Astronomy and Aerospace Science"}], "options": {"A": "Economics", "B": "Political Science and Philosophy", "C": "Sociology", "D": "Astronomy and Aerospace Science (Odd one out - not part of his Columbia curriculum)"}, "explanation": "Textbook Page 159: Ambedkar studied Economics, Politics, Philosophy, and Sociology at Columbia. Astronomy/Aerospace is the odd one out."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": {"left": [], "right": []}, "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "D", "accepted_keys": ["D"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "answer_notes": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false, "shuffle_options": true, "is_active_eligible": true}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "8", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 159, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": null, "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null, "question_number": null, "official_question_paper_url": null, "official_answer_key_url": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["8th-tamil", "iyal-8", "ambedkar", "curriculum", "odd-one-out", "tnpsc"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-03T00:00:00Z", "updated_by": null, "updated_at": null, "verified_by": "subject_expert_tamil", "verified_at": "2026-11-03T00:00:00Z", "archived_at": null}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "8th-u8-q1033", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "odd_one_out", "level": "SSLC", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "8", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "ta-8th-u8-manitham", "lesson_id": "8th-u8-l2", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "ambedkar-organisations-odd-one", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "அம்பேத்கருடன் தொடர்புடைய வரலாற்று அமைப்புகளுள் பொருந்தாத ஒன்றைத் தேர்வு செய்க:\nஅ) திராவிட மகாஜன சங்கம்\nஆ) ஒடுக்கப்பட்டோர் நல்வாழ்வுப் பேரவை\nஇ) சமாஜ் சமாத சங்கம்\nஈ) சுதந்திரத் தொழிலாளர் கட்சி"}], "options": {"A": "திராவிட மகாஜன சங்கம் (இது அயோத்திதாசரால் 1892-இல் தோற்றுவிக்கப்பட்டது)", "B": "ஒடுக்கப்பட்டோர் நல்வாழ்வுப் பேரவை", "C": "சமாஜ் சமாத சங்கம்", "D": "சுதந்திரத் தொழிலாளர் கட்சி"}, "explanation": "பாடநூல் பக். 159-160: ஒடுக்கப்பட்டோர் நல்வாழ்வுப் பேரவை (1924), சமாஜ் சமாத சங்கம், சுதந்திரத் தொழிலாளர் கட்சி (1935) ஆகியவற்றை நிறுவியவர் அம்பேத்கர். திராவிட மகாஜன சங்கம் 1892-இல் அயோத்திதாசரால் நிறுவப்பட்டது."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Which of the following organizations is NOT founded by Ambedkar (Odd one out)?\na) Dravida Mahajana Sangam\nb) Bahishkrit Hitakarini Sabha\nc) Samaj Samata Sangh\nd) Independent Labour Party"}], "options": {"A": "Dravida Mahajana Sangam (Odd one out - founded by Ayothidhasar in 1892)", "B": "Bahishkrit Hitakarini Sabha", "C": "Samaj Samata Sangh", "D": "Independent Labour Party"}, "explanation": "Textbook Pages 159-160: Bahishkrit Hitakarini Sabha, Samaj Samata Sangh, and Independent Labour Party were founded by Ambedkar. Dravida Mahajana Sangam was founded by Ayothidhasar."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": {"left": [], "right": []}, "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "A", "accepted_keys": ["A"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "answer_notes": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false, "shuffle_options": true, "is_active_eligible": true}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "8", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 159, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": null, "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null, "question_number": null, "official_question_paper_url": null, "official_answer_key_url": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["8th-tamil", "iyal-8", "ambedkar", "historical-bodies", "odd-one-out", "tnpsc"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-03T00:00:00Z", "updated_by": null, "updated_at": null, "verified_by": "subject_expert_tamil", "verified_at": "2026-11-03T00:00:00Z", "archived_at": null}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "8th-u8-q1034", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "odd_one_out", "level": "SSLC", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "8", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "ta-8th-u1-mozhi", "lesson_id": "8th-u8-l2", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "three-deities-odd-one", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "அம்பேத்கர் போற்றிய மூன்று தெய்வங்களுள் சேராத - பொருந்தாத ஒன்றைத் தேர்வு செய்க:\nஅ) அறிவு\nஆ) ஆதிக்க வலிமை (வன்முறை)\nஇ) சுயமரியாதை\nஈ) நன்னடத்தை"}], "options": {"A": "அறிவு", "B": "ஆதிக்க வலிமை (இது அம்பேத்கர் போற்றிய தெய்வம் அன்று)", "C": "சுயமரியாதை", "D": "நன்னடத்தை"}, "explanation": "பாடநூல் பக். 159 தெரிந்து தெளிவோம்: அம்பேத்கர் போற்றிய மூன்று தெய்வங்கள்: 1. அறிவு, 2. சுயமரியாதை, 3. நன்னடத்தை. ஆதிக்க வலிமை என்பது பொருந்தாதது."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Which of the following is NOT one of the three deities revered by Ambedkar (Odd one out)?\na) Knowledge (Arivu)\nb) Hegemonic Coercion / Violence\nc) Self-Respect (Suyamariyaadhai)\nd) Noble Conduct (Nannadatthai)"}], "options": {"A": "Knowledge", "B": "Hegemonic Coercion / Violence (Odd one out - not a deity of Ambedkar)", "C": "Self-Respect", "D": "Noble Conduct"}, "explanation": "Textbook Page 159: Ambedkar's three deities are Knowledge, Self-Respect, and Noble Conduct. Coercive dominance is the odd one out."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": {"left": [], "right": []}, "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "B", "accepted_keys": ["B"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "answer_notes": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false, "shuffle_options": true, "is_active_eligible": true}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "8", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 159, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": null, "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null, "question_number": null, "official_question_paper_url": null, "official_answer_key_url": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["8th-tamil", "iyal-8", "ambedkar", "three-deities", "odd-one-out", "tnpsc"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-03T00:00:00Z", "updated_by": null, "updated_at": null, "verified_by": "subject_expert_tamil", "verified_at": "2026-11-03T00:00:00Z", "archived_at": null}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "8th-u8-q1035", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "direct", "level": "SSLC", "difficulty": "easy", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "8", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "ta-8th-u1-mozhi", "lesson_id": "8th-u8-l2", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "first-printed-book-direct", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "அச்சில் வெளிவந்த அம்பேத்கரின் முதல் நூல் எது?"}], "options": {"A": "பண்டைய கால இந்திய வணிகம்", "B": "இந்தியாவின் தேசியப் பங்கு வீதம்", "C": "இந்தியாவில் சாதிகளின் தோற்றமும் வளர்ச்சியும்", "D": "ரூபாய் பற்றிய பிரச்சனை"}, "explanation": "பாடநூல் பக். 159: 'இந்தியாவில் சாதிகளின் தோற்றமும் வளர்ச்சியும்' என்னும் தலைப்பில் படைத்த ஆய்வுக் கட்டுரையே சிறு புத்தகமாக அச்சில் வெளிவந்த அம்பேத்கரின் முதல் நூல் ஆகும்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Which was the very first book of Ambedkar to be published in print?"}], "options": {"A": "Ancient Indian Commerce", "B": "National Dividend of India", "C": "Castes in India: Their Mechanism, Genesis and Development", "D": "The Problem of the Rupee"}, "explanation": "Textbook Page 159: 'Castes in India: Their Mechanism, Genesis and Development' was Ambedkar's first published book in print."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": {"left": [], "right": []}, "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "C", "accepted_keys": ["C"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "answer_notes": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false, "shuffle_options": true, "is_active_eligible": true}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "